Initial: MiMo Web3 Research Agent v0.1.0

AI-powered Web3 research agent built on Xiaomi MiMo API.

Features:
- Whale watching across Arbitrum, Base, Optimism
- Social listening via Farcaster (Neynar) + X
- News aggregation from top crypto RSS feeds
- MiMo-powered sentiment analysis & daily briefings
- Telegram bot with 8 commands
- Cron-ready automation scripts
- SQLite storage with caching layer

Submission for Xiaomi MiMo Orbit 100T Creator Program.
